### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@apiPath = /api

### Health Check - Root endpoint
GET {{baseUrl}}

### Get All Events
GET {{baseUrl}}{{apiPath}}/events
Content-Type: application/json

### Create New Event - Complete Example
POST {{baseUrl}}{{apiPath}}/events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Tech Conference 2025",
  "description": "Annual technology conference featuring the latest innovations in software development, AI, and cloud computing",
  "location": "San Francisco Convention Center, CA",
  "start_date": "2025-09-15T09:00:00Z",
  "end_date": "2025-09-17T18:00:00Z",
  "category": "Technology",
  "organizer": "Tech Events Inc",
  "max_attendees": 500,
  "status": "published",
  "metadata": {
    "tags": ["tech", "conference", "AI", "cloud"],
    "website": "https://techconf2025.example.com",
    "contact_email": "info@techconf2025.example.com"
  }
}

### Create New Event - Music Festival
POST {{baseUrl}}{{apiPath}}/events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Summer Music Festival 2025",
  "description": "Three-day music festival featuring international artists and local bands",
  "location": "Central Park, Los Angeles, CA",
  "start_date": "2025-07-20T14:00:00Z",
  "end_date": "2025-07-22T23:00:00Z",
  "category": "Music",
  "organizer": "Music Events LLC",
  "max_attendees": 10000,
  "status": "published",
  "metadata": {
    "tags": ["music", "festival", "outdoor"],
    "ticket_price": "$150",
    "age_restriction": "18+"
  }
}

### Create New Event - Workshop (Draft Status)
POST {{baseUrl}}{{apiPath}}/events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Web Development Workshop for Beginners",
  "description": "Hands-on workshop covering HTML, CSS, and JavaScript fundamentals",
  "location": "Code Academy, New York, NY",
  "start_date": "2025-06-01T10:00:00Z",
  "end_date": "2025-06-01T16:00:00Z",
  "category": "Education",
  "organizer": "Code Academy",
  "max_attendees": 30,
  "status": "draft",
  "metadata": {
    "tags": ["workshop", "coding", "beginners"],
    "prerequisites": "None",
    "materials_provided": true
  }
}

### Create New Event - Minimal Required Fields
POST {{baseUrl}}{{apiPath}}/events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Quick Meetup Event",
  "start_date": "2025-08-20T18:00:00Z",
  "end_date": "2025-08-20T20:00:00Z"
}

### Create New Event - Sports Event
POST {{baseUrl}}{{apiPath}}/events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "City Marathon 2025",
  "description": "Annual city marathon with 5K, 10K, and full marathon categories",
  "location": "Downtown City Streets",
  "start_date": "2025-10-12T07:00:00Z",
  "end_date": "2025-10-12T14:00:00Z",
  "category": "Sports",
  "organizer": "City Sports Association",
  "max_attendees": 2000,
  "status": "published",
  "metadata": {
    "tags": ["marathon", "running", "fitness"],
    "registration_deadline": "2025-09-30",
    "categories": ["5K", "10K", "Full Marathon"]
  }
}

### Create New Event - Cancelled Status
POST {{baseUrl}}{{apiPath}}/events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Postponed Art Exhibition",
  "description": "Contemporary art exhibition - currently cancelled",
  "location": "City Art Gallery",
  "start_date": "2025-05-01T10:00:00Z",
  "end_date": "2025-05-15T18:00:00Z",
  "category": "Art",
  "organizer": "City Art Council",
  "max_attendees": 200,
  "status": "cancelled",
  "metadata": {
    "cancellation_reason": "Venue renovation",
    "refund_available": true
  }
}

### Create New Event - Completed Status
POST {{baseUrl}}{{apiPath}}/events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Past Networking Event",
  "description": "Business networking event that has already concluded",
  "location": "Business Hub, Seattle, WA",
  "start_date": "2024-12-15T18:00:00Z",
  "end_date": "2024-12-15T21:00:00Z",
  "category": "Business",
  "organizer": "Professional Network Group",
  "max_attendees": 100,
  "status": "completed",
  "metadata": {
    "attendees_count": 87,
    "feedback_rating": 4.5
  }
}
